      "writtenOn": "2022-04-12T19:08:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In practice, the default values aren\u0027t used. We don\u0027t default-construct Words; I was just being defensive. I\u0027ll remove the defaults.\n\nA SpvId of -1 is the SPIR-V code generator\u0027s sentinel for \"no SpvId here.\" To make this more clear to a casual reader, I\u0027ve put up a CL assigning these a name:  http://review.skia.org/529519 \n\nIf we wanted to represent a `Word` without no value, we could put its `fKind` as `kNone` and then the `fValue` would be ignored. But that isn\u0027t something we actually need at this CL.",
      "parentUuid": "3c75e23f_bc859e67",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 132,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 132,
        "endChar": 23
